    "Menu language changes now. In-game language is only requested at next launch and may remain English if the WebAssembly game does not support it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu language changes now. In-game language is only requested at next launch and may remain English if the WebAssembly game does not support it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 介面語言立即切換；遊戲內語言會在下次啟動時嘗試套用，但網頁遊戲引擎仍可能顯示英文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the phone to fine-tune your aim; turning your body turns the camera. Tilt steering turns the phone like a steering wheel: Assist adds fine control on top of the touch steering, Tilt to steer replaces it. The straight-ahead angle is however you hold the phone when you get in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move the phone to fine-tune your aim; turning your body turns the camera. Tilt steering turns the phone like a steering wheel: Assist adds fine control on top of the touch steering, Tilt to steer replaces it. The straight-ahead angle is however you hold the phone when you get in."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移動手機可微調瞄準。傾斜轉向能把手機當方向盤：「輔助」會配合觸控轉向；「傾斜控制」則改用手機傾斜操作。上車時的持機角度會設定為正前方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
