    "The game folder was moved or deleted. Put it back in Files › On My iPhone › GTA V Port, or pick it again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The game folder was moved or deleted. Put it back in Files › On My iPhone › GTA V Port, or pick it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遊戲資料夾可能已移動或刪除。請將它移回「檔案 › 我的 iPhone › GTA V Port」，或重新選取資料夾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game reads everything from this iPhone. Removing the files frees the space; the game then streams again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The game reads everything from this iPhone. Removing the files frees the space; the game then streams again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遊戲會直接讀取手機上的資料；刪除後可騰出空間，但之後必須重新使用串流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The simulator reads the Mac's game files directly. Launch with --stream-assets to test downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The simulator reads the Mac's game files directly. Launch with --stream-assets to test downloads."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模擬器會直接讀取 Mac 上的遊戲檔案。如要測試下載，請使用 --stream-assets 啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no complete game folder in Files › On My iPhone › GTA V Port yet.\n\nOpen the Files app, find your game folder (the one with \"data\" and \"b\" inside), long-press it, tap Move, and choose On My iPhone › GTA V Port. If you got a .rar or .zip, unpack it first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no complete game folder in Files › On My iPhone › GTA V Port yet.\n\nOpen the Files app, find your game folder (the one with \"data\" and \"b\" inside), long-press it, tap Move, and choose On My iPhone › GTA V Port. If you got a .rar or .zip, unpack it first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「檔案 › 我的 iPhone › GTA V Port」尚未找到完整遊戲資料。\n\n請在「檔案」App 找到含有 \"data\" 與 \"b\" 的遊戲資料夾，長按選擇「移動」至「我的 iPhone › GTA V Port」。若是 .rar 或 .zip，請先解壓縮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no game in \"{arg0}\". Pick the folder that has both \"data\" and \"b\" inside (or any folder above it).\n\nEasiest: move your game folder into Files › On My iPhone › GTA V Port. The app finds it there by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no game in \"{arg0}\". Pick the folder that has both \"data\" and \"b\" inside (or any folder above it).\n\nEasiest: move your game folder into Files › On My iPhone › GTA V Port. The app finds it there by itself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「{arg0}」中找不到遊戲。請選擇包含「data」與「b」的資料夾，或其上層資料夾。\n\n建議將整個遊戲資料夾移至「檔案 › 我的 iPhone › GTA V Port」，App 會自動偵測。"
          }
        }
      }
